*.pbxproj -text
# specific for windows script files
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Vendored native binaries are committed inline (not Git LFS). Public-fork
# LFS uploads are blocked by GitHub policy, so the previously-LFS .a / .so /
# xcframework Mach-O patterns are stored as plain binary blobs. The
# `!filter !merge !diff` negations explicitly clear any inherited LFS
# attributes so the smudge/clean filters never re-attach. `git lfs migrate
# export` rewrote the existing branch history to drop the pointers in
# place.
*.a              !text !filter !merge !diff
*.so             !text !filter !merge !diff
**/ExecutorchLib !text !filter !merge !diff
**/opencv2       !text !filter !merge !diff
